            (Contact/person)."""@en;
                        rdfs:domain ebucore:Agent;
                        rdfs:label "Homepage (private)"@en;
                        rdfs:range xsd:anyURI;
                        rdfs:subPropertyOf ebucore:agentWebHomepage;
                        owl:equivalentProperty foaf:homepage.
ebucore:privateMailAddress a rdf:Property;
                           rdfs:comment """To provide the private / personal address of an
            agent (Contact/person)."""@en;
                           rdfs:label "Private mail address"@en;
                           rdfs:range xsd:string;
                           rdfs:subPropertyOf ebucore:agentAddress.
ebucore:privateMobileTelephoneNumber a rdf:Property;
                                     rdfs:comment """To provide the private mobile telephone number
            of an agent (Contact/person)."""@en;
                                     rdfs:label "Mobile (private)"@en;
                                     rdfs:subPropertyOf ebucore:agentMobileTelephoneNumber.
ebucore:privateTelephoneNumber a rdf:Property;
                               rdfs:comment """To provide the private telephone number of an
            Agent (Contact/person)."""@en;
                               rdfs:label "Telephone (private)"@en;
                               rdfs:range xsd:string;
                               rdfs:subPropertyOf ebucore:agentTelephoneNumber.
ebucore:promotionalInformation a rdf:Property;
                               rdfs:comment "To provide textual promotional information."@en;
                               rdfs:label "Promotional information"@en;
                               rdfs:subPropertyOf ebucore:description.
ebucore:pubStatus a rdf:Property;
                  rdfs:comment "To indicate a publication status."@en;
                  rdfs:label "Publication status"@en;
                  rdfs:subPropertyOf ebucore:description.
ebucore:publicationChannelName a rdf:Property;
                               rdfs:comment "To provide a name to a PublicationChannel e.g. a TV channel or website."@en;
                               rdfs:domain ebucore:PublicationChannel;
                               rdfs:label "Publication channel name"@en;
                               rdfs:range xsd:string.
ebucore:publicationEndDateTime a rdf:Property;
                               rdfs:comment "The actual end date and time of a PublicationEvent."@en;
                               rdfs:domain ebucore:PublicationEvent;
                               rdfs:label "Publication end date & time"@en;
                               rdfs:range xsd:dateTime.
ebucore:publicationEventName a rdf:Property;
                             rdfs:comment "To provide a name to a PublicationEvent."@en;
                             rdfs:domain ebucore:PublicationEvent;
                             rdfs:label "Publication event name"@en;
                             rdfs:range xsd:string.
ebucore:publicationScheduleDate a rdf:Property;
                                rdfs:comment "To express specifically the schedule date to which a PublicationEvent is related in particular if the broacdast time is after midnight. For example, the schedule date would be May 29th and the programme is published at 1 am on May 30th, while still associated in the schedule with the night of May 29th."@en;
                                rdfs:domain ebucore:PublicationEvent;
                                rdfs:label "schedule date"@en;
                                rdfs:range xsd:date.
ebucore:publicationStartDateTime a rdf:Property;
                                 rdfs:comment "The actual start date and time of a PublicationEvent."@en;
                                 rdfs:domain ebucore:PublicationEvent;
                                 rdfs:label "Publication start date & time"@en;
                                 rdfs:range xsd:dateTime.
ebucore:publishedEndDateTime a rdf:Property;
                             rdfs:comment """The end date and time of a PublicationEvent as
            scheduled."""@en;
                             rdfs:domain ebucore:PublicationEvent;
                             rdfs:label "Publication end date & time"@en;
                             rdfs:range xsd:dateTime.
ebucore:publishedStartDateTime a rdf:Property;
                               rdfs:comment """The start date and time of a PublicationEvent
            as scheduled."""@en;
                               rdfs:domain ebucore:PublicationEvent;
                               rdfs:label "Publication start date & time"@en;
                               rdfs:range xsd:dateTime.
ebucore:publishedTitle a rdf:Property;
                       rdfs:comment "The title used to identify the work at publication time."@en;
                       rdfs:label "Published title."@en;
                       rdfs:range xsd:string;
                       rdfs:subPropertyOf dc11:title.
ebucore:ratingScaleMax a rdf:Property;
                       rdfs:comment """The maximum value of the scale used for rating
            a media resource."""@en;
                       rdfs:domain ebucore:Rating;
                       rdfs:label "Rating scale (top value)"@en;
                       rdfs:range xsd:string;
                       owl:equivalentProperty ma-ont:ratingScaleMax.
ebucore:ratingScaleMin a rdf:Property;
                       rdfs:comment """The minimum value of the scale used for rating
            a Resource."""@en;
                       rdfs:domain ebucore:Rating;
                       rdfs:label "Rating scale (min. value)"@en;
                       rdfs:range xsd:string;
                       owl:equivalentProperty ma-ont:ratingScaleMin.
ebucore:ratingSystemEnvironment a rdf:Property;
                                rdfs:comment "To identify the environment in which rating applies."@en;
                                rdfs:domain ebucore:Rating;
                                rdfs:label "Rating environment"@en;
                                rdfs:range xsd:string;
                                owl:equivalentProperty ma-ont:hasRatingSystem.
ebucore:ratingSystemName a rdf:Property;
                         rdfs:comment "To identify a rating system by its name."@en;
                         rdfs:domain ebucore:Rating;
                         rdfs:label "Rating system"@en;
                         rdfs:range xsd:string;
                         owl:equivalentProperty ma-ont:hasRatingSystem.
ebucore:ratingValue a rdf:Property;
                    rdfs:comment """To express a free text rating value defined in
            a rating classification scheme."""@en;
                    rdfs:domain ebucore:Rating;
                    rdfs:label "Rating"@en;
                    rdfs:range xsd:string;
                    owl:equivalentProperty ma-ont:ratingValue.
ebucore:reason a rdf:Property;
               rdfs:comment "To provide a reason for which Rating as been attributed as provided."@en;
               rdfs:domain ebucore:Rating;
               rdfs:label "Reason"@en;
               rdfs:range xsd:string.
ebucore:references a rdf:Property;
                   rdfs:comment "To express a reference between Assets, BusinessObjects or Resources."@en;
                   rdfs:domain [owl:unionOf (ebucore:Asset
                                             ebucore:BusinessObject
                                             ebucore:Resource) ; 
                                a owl:Class];
                   rdfs:label "References"@en;
                   rdfs:range [owl:unionOf (ebucore:Asset
                                            ebucore:BusinessObject
                                            ebucore:Resource) ; 
                               a owl:Class];
                   rdfs:subPropertyOf dc11:relation.
ebucore:regionDelimX a rdf:Property;
                     rdfs:comment """To define the bottom right corner of a zone on
            the x-axis. If present with regionDelimY, the zone definition is complemented by the
            associated values of the height and width."""@en;
                     rdfs:domain ebucore:Resource;
                     rdfs:label "Region delimiter (x-axis)"@en;
                     rdfs:range xsd:integer.
ebucore:regionDelimY a rdf:Property;
                     rdfs:comment """To define the bottom right corner of a zone on
            the y-axis. If present with regionDelimX, the zone definition is complemented by the
            associated values of the height and width."""@en;
                     rdfs:domain ebucore:Resource;
                     rdfs:label "Region delimiter (y-axis)"@en;
                     rdfs:range xsd:integer.
ebucore:relatedLink a rdf:Property;
                    rdfs:comment """To provide a link to a web resource containing
            information related to an Agent (Contact/person or Organisation)."""@en;
                    rdfs:domain ebucore:Agent;
                    rdfs:label "Related resources"@en;
                    rdfs:range xsd:anyURI.
ebucore:replaces a rdf:Property;
                 rdfs:comment "To identify substitution."@en;
                 rdfs:domain [owl:unionOf (ebucore:Asset
                                           ebucore:BusinessObject
                                           ebucore:Resource) ; 
                              a owl:Class];
                 rdfs:label "Replaces"@en;
                 rdfs:range [owl:unionOf (ebucore:Asset
                                          ebucore:BusinessObject
                                          ebucore:Resource) ; 
                             a owl:Class];
                 rdfs:subPropertyOf dc11:relation.
ebucore:requires a rdf:Property;
                 rdfs:comment "To express dependency."@en;
                 rdfs:domain [owl:unionOf (ebucore:Asset
                                           ebucore:BusinessObject
                                           ebucore:Resource) ; 
                              a owl:Class];
                 rdfs:label "Requires"@en;
                 rdfs:range [owl:unionOf (ebucore:Asset
                                          ebucore:BusinessObject
                                          ebucore:Resource) ; 
                             a owl:Class];
                 rdfs:subPropertyOf dc11:relation.
ebucore:resourceDescription a rdf:Property;
                            rdfs:comment """This can be specialised by using sub-properties
            like defined in http://www.ebu.ch/metadata/cs/web/ebu_DescriptionTypeCodeCS_p.xml.htm
            implemented as examples as e.g. 'summary' or
            'script'.""";
                            rdfs:domain ebucore:MediaResource;
                            rdfs:label "Resource description";
                            rdfs:range xsd:string;
                            rdfs:subPropertyOf dc11:description.
ebucore:resourceName a rdf:Property;
                     rdfs:comment "A name by which the resource can be identified."@en;
                     rdfs:domain ebucore:Resource;
                     rdfs:label "Resource description"@en;
                     rdfs:range xsd:string.
ebucore:review a rdf:Property;
               rdfs:comment "To provide a text for a review."@en;
               rdfs:label "Review"@en;
               rdfs:subPropertyOf ebucore:description.
ebucore:rightsExpression a rdf:Property;
                         rdfs:comment """The expression of Rights as free
            text."""@en;
                         rdfs:domain ebucore:Rights;
                         rdfs:label "Rights expression"@en;
                         rdfs:range xsd:string.
ebucore:rightsLink a rdf:Property;
                   rdfs:comment """A link to e.g. a webpage where an expression of
            the rights can be found and consulted."""@en;
                   rdfs:domain ebucore:Rights;
                   rdfs:label "Rights web resource"@en;
                   rdfs:range xsd:anyURI.
ebucore:roleDefinition a rdf:Property;
                       rdfs:comment "To provide a definition for a role"@en;
                       rdfs:domain ebucore:Role;
                       rdfs:label "Role definition"@en;
                       rdfs:range xsd:string.
ebucore:sampleRate a rdf:Property;
                   rdfs:comment "The frequency at which audio is sampled per second. Also called sampling rate."@en;
                   rdfs:label "Sample Rate"@en;
                   rdfs:range xsd:integer;
                   owl:equivalentProperty ma-ont:samplingRate.
ebucore:sampleSize a rdf:Property;
                   rdfs:comment """The size of an audio sample in
            bits. Also called bit depth."""@en;
                   rdfs:domain ebucore:AudioFormat;
                   rdfs:label "Sample size"@en;
                   rdfs:range xsd:integer.
ebucore:sampleType a rdf:Property;
                   rdfs:comment "The type of audio sample."@en;
                   rdfs:domain ebucore:AudioFormat;
                   rdfs:label "Sample type"@en;
                   rdfs:range xsd:string.
ebucore:scanningFormat a rdf:Property;
                       rdfs:comment """To define the scanning format for a
            MediaResource. For video, the two main values are \"interlaced\" or
            \"progressive\"."""@en;
                       rdfs:domain ebucore:VideoFormat;
                       rdfs:label "Sampling format"@en;
                       rdfs:range xsd:string.
ebucore:script a rdf:Property;
               rdfs:comment "To provide a script."@en;
               rdfs:label "Script"@en;
               rdfs:subPropertyOf ebucore:description.
ebucore:shotlog a rdf:Property;
                rdfs:comment "Provides a shot-by-shot description of resource content."@en;
                rdfs:label "Shot log"@en;
                rdfs:subPropertyOf ebucore:description.
ebucore:signingSource a rdf:Property;
                      rdfs:comment """To identify the source of the signing
            resource."""@en;
                      rdfs:domain ebucore:Signing;
                      rdfs:label "Signing source"@en;
                      rdfs:range xsd:string.
ebucore:start a rdf:Property;
              rdfs:comment "The start point of the MediaResource."@en;
              rdfs:domain [owl:unionOf (ebucore:MediaResource
                                        ebucore:EditorialObject) ; 
                           a owl:Class];
              rdfs:label "Start time"@en;
              rdfs:range rdfs:Literal.
ebucore:startNormalPlayTime a rdf:Property;
                            rdfs:comment """The start time expressed using a time
            expression."""@en;
                            rdfs:label "Start time (time)"@en;
                            rdfs:range xsd:time;
                            rdfs:subPropertyOf ebucore:start.
ebucore:startNumberEditUnits a rdf:Property;
                             rdfs:comment """A start time expressed as a number of edit
            units."""@en;
                             rdfs:label "Start time (edit units)"@en;
                             rdfs:range xsd:double;
                             rdfs:subPropertyOf ebucore:start.
ebucore:startTimecode a rdf:Property;
                      rdfs:comment """A start time expressed as
            timecode."""@en;
                      rdfs:label "Start time (timecode)"@en;
                      rdfs:range xsd:string;
                      rdfs:subPropertyOf ebucore:start.
ebucore:storageDefinition a rdf:Property;
                          rdfs:comment "To provide a definition for storage."@en;
                          rdfs:domain ebucore:StorageType;
                          rdfs:label "Storage definition"@en;
                          rdfs:range xsd:string.
ebucore:subtitle a rdf:Property;
                 rdfs:comment "A complementary subtitle."@en;
                 rdfs:label "Subtitle"@en;
                 rdfs:subPropertyOf ebucore:alternativeTitle.
ebucore:subtitlingSource a rdf:Property;
                         rdfs:comment """To identify the source of the Subtitling
            resource."""@en;
                         rdfs:domain ebucore:Subtitling;
                         rdfs:label "Subtitling source"@en;
                         rdfs:range xsd:string.
ebucore:summary a rdf:Property;
                rdfs:comment "To provide a summary."@en;
                rdfs:label "Summary"@en;
                rdfs:range xsd:string;
                rdfs:subPropertyOf ebucore:description.
ebucore:synopsis a rdf:Property;
                 rdfs:comment "To provide a summary."@en;
                 rdfs:label "Synopsis"@en;
                 rdfs:range xsd:string;
                 rdfs:subPropertyOf ebucore:description.
ebucore:tableOfContent a rdf:Property;
                       rdfs:comment "To provide a Table of Content."@en;
                       rdfs:label "Table of Content"@en;
                       rdfs:subPropertyOf ebucore:description.
ebucore:targetAudienceSystem a rdf:Property;
                             rdfs:comment "To define the system used to provide a TargetAudience."@en;
                             rdfs:domain ebucore:audienceLevel;
                             rdfs:label "Target audience system"@en;
                             rdfs:range xsd:string.
ebucore:textualAnnotation a rdf:Property;
                          rdfs:comment """The value of an Annotation as free
            text."""@en;
                          rdfs:domain ebucore:Annotation;
                          rdfs:label "Note"@en;
                          rdfs:range xsd:string.
ebucore:title a rdf:Property;
              rdfs:comment """All value of the EBU title status
            classification scheme
            (http://www.ebu.ch/metadata/cs/web/ebu_TitleStatusCodeCS_p.xml.htm) are candidates
            subproperties of the title property as implemented for an example with
            alternativeTitle."""@en,
                           """Specifies the title or name given to the
            resource.  A root for the definition of subproperties defining ebucore titles of different types. The ebucore title type can be used to define sub-properties to optionally refine the category of
            the title."""@en;
              rdfs:label "Title"@en;
              rdfs:subPropertyOf dc11:title;
              owl:equivalentProperty ma-ont:title.
ebucore:trackDefinition a rdf:Property;
                        rdfs:comment """To provide a definition associated to a
            Track."""@en;
                        rdfs:domain ebucore:Track;
                        rdfs:label "Definition"@en;
                        rdfs:range xsd:string.
ebucore:trackName a rdf:Property;
                  rdfs:comment "The name attributed to a Track."@en;
                  rdfs:domain ebucore:Track;
                  rdfs:label "Track name"@en;
                  rdfs:range xsd:string;
                  owl:equivalentProperty ma-ont:trackName.
ebucore:translationTitle a rdf:Property;
                         rdfs:comment "A translated version of the title."@en;
                         rdfs:label "Translation title"@en;
                         rdfs:subPropertyOf ebucore:alternativeTitle.
ebucore:versionTitle a rdf:Property;
                     rdfs:comment "An alternative title specific to a verison of content."@en;
                     rdfs:label "Version title"@en;
                     rdfs:subPropertyOf ebucore:alternativeTitle.
ebucore:width a rdf:Property;
              rdfs:comment """The width of e.g. a video frame typically
            expressed as a number of pixels, or picture/image in millimeters."""@en;
              rdfs:domain ebucore:Resource;
              rdfs:label "Width"@en;
              rdfs:range xsd:integer;
              owl:equivalentProperty ma-ont:frameWidth.
ebucore:widthUnit a rdf:Property;
                  rdfs:comment """The unit used to measure a width e.g. in pixels
            or number of lines or millimeters or else."""@en;
                  rdfs:domain ebucore:Resource;
                  rdfs:label "Width unit"@en;
                  rdfs:range xsd:string.
ebucore:wordCount a rdf:Property;
                  rdfs:comment """The number of words contained in a
            document."""@en;
                  rdfs:domain ebucore:Document;
                  rdfs:label "Word count"@en;
                  rdfs:range xsd:integer.
ebucore:workingTitle a rdf:Property;
                     rdfs:comment "A title used while content is not complete."@en;
                     rdfs:label "Working title"@en;
                     rdfs:subPropertyOf ebucore:alternativeTitle.
ebucore:wrappingType a rdf:Property;
                     rdfs:comment """To provide additional information on the
            wrapping type of ancillary data."""@en;
                     rdfs:domain ebucore:AncillaryData;
                     rdfs:label "Wrapping type"@en;
                     rdfs:range xsd:string.
skos:Collection rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core>.
skos:Concept rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core>.
skos:ConceptScheme rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core>.
skos:OrderedCollection rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core>.
skos:altLabel rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core>.
skos:broadMatch rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core>.
skos:broader rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core>.
skos:broaderTransitive rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core>.
skos:changeNote rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core>.
skos:closeMatch rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core>.
skos:definition rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core>.
skos:editorialNote rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core>.
skos:exactMatch rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core>.
skos:example rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core>.
skos:hasTopConcept rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core>.
skos:hiddenLabel rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core>.
skos:historyNote rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core>.
skos:inScheme rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core>.
skos:mappingRelation rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core>.
skos:member rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core>.
skos:memberList rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core>.
skos:narrowMatch rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core>.
skos:narrower rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core>.
skos:narrowerTransitive rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core>.
skos:notation rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core>.
skos:note rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core>.
skos:prefLabel rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core>.
skos:related rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core>.
skos:relatedMatch rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core>.
skos:scopeNote rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core>.
skos:semanticRelation rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core>.
skos:topConceptOf rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core>.
ma-ont:averageBitRate a rdf:Property;
                      rdfs:comment "The average bit rate as defined in the media annotation ontology (ma-ont) http://www.w3.org/TR/mediaont-10/";
                      rdfs:label "Average bit rate";
                      rdfs:range xsd:integer;
                      skos:prefLabel "Average bit rate".
ma-ont:hasPermissions a rdf:Property;
                      rdfs:comment "To define permissions as defined in the W3C media ontology (ma-ont)";
                      rdfs:label "Permissions";
                      skos:prefLabel "Permissions".
ma-ont:isRelatedTo a rdf:Property;
                   rdfs:comment "To define relations as defined in the W3C media ontology (ma-ont)";
                   rdfs:label "Relation";
                   skos:prefLabel "Relation".
foaf:Agent a rdfs:Class;
           rdfs:comment "A person or Organisation."@en;
           rdfs:label "Agent"@en;
           rdfs:subClassOf dc11:Agent.
foaf:Group a rdfs:Class;
           rdfs:comment "A group of Agents."@en;
           rdfs:label "Group"@en;
           rdfs:subClassOf owl:Thing.
foaf:Organization a rdfs:Class;
                  rdfs:comment "An organisation (business, corporation, federation, etc.) or moral agent (gvernment body)."@en;
                  rdfs:label "Organization"@en;
                  rdfs:subClassOf ebucore:Organisation.
foaf:age a rdf:Property;
         rdfs:label "age";
         rdfs:subPropertyOf ebucore:agentAge.
foaf:familyName rdfs:subPropertyOf ebucore:familyName.
foaf:givenName rdfs:subPropertyOf ebucore:givenName.
foaf:img a rdfs:Class;
         rdfs:comment "Animage to represent something."@en;
         rdfs:label "Image"@en;
         rdfs:subClassOf ebucore:Picture.
foaf:member a rdf:Property;
            rdfs:comment "To identify an Agent member of a Group."@en;
            rdfs:domain foaf:Group;
            rdfs:label "Group member"@en;
            rdfs:range foaf:Agent.
foaf:name a rdf:Property;
          rdfs:comment "To name an Agent."@en;
          rdfs:domain foaf:Agent;
          rdfs:label "Name"@en;
          rdfs:range xsd:string.
foaf:person a rdfs:Class;
            rdfs:comment "all types of people such as politicians, athletes, historic figures, contributors in programmes e.t.c."@en;
            rdfs:label "Person"@en;
            rdfs:subClassOf ebucore:Contact.
foaf:title rdfs:subPropertyOf ebucore:nameTitle.
